 indicate where they lived. Choice C is incorrect. This choice mentions that <em>My &Aacute;ntonia</em> is one of Cather&rsquo;s best-known novels but doesn&rsquo;t state where it takes place. Choice D is incorrect. This choice mentions that some of Cather&rsquo;s novels are set in Nebraska, but it doesn&rsquo;t specify which ones, so we can&rsquo;t be certain that <em>My &Aacute;ntonia</em> is one of them. It also includes irrelevant information about Cather&rsquo;s education.</p>","parenttemplatename":"OSP-KA-SYN-E005","parenttemplateid":"","templateclusterid":"f7944e17-457f-40f4-8c60-6ec726a93392","templateclustername":"","origin":"proteus","position":"0","createDate":1691007959371,"updateDate":1691007959371}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959371, 1691007959371),
    ($SATQ$00bb356a$SATQ$, $SATQ$e0204d9d-b533-4d08-a0f5-d17a2366902b$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$Reading and Writing$SATQ$, $SATQ$Expression of Ideas$SATQ$, $SATQ$EOI$SATQ$, $SATQ$SYN$SATQ$, $SATQ$Rhetorical Synthesis$SATQ$, $SATQ$E$SATQ$, 3, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:</p>
<ul>
<li>Miguel Luciano is a multimedia visual artist.</li>
<li>One of his sculptures is <em>Double Phantom/EntroP.R</em>. (2017).</li>
<li>The work consists of two red Schwinn Phantom bicycles that he fused together.</li>
<li>The bicycles face opposite directions.</li>
<li>The bicycles share the same rear wheel.</li>
</ul>$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>The student wants to describe how the bicycles in <em>Double Phantom/EntroP.R. </em>are fused together. Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"3f5e0780-405a-41db-a2ff-f2e0259992f2","content":"<p>To create the sculpture <em>Double Phantom/EntroP.R.</em>, Miguel Luciano fused together two Schwinn Phantom bicycles.</p>"},{"id":"4af13713-3e39-4e92-b4f7-060875b7229c","content":"<p>There are two red Schwinn Phantom bicycles in the sculpture <em>Double Phantom/EntroP.R.</em></p>"},{"id":"886da572-2843-47c8-a23a-18ff7d0a6fc6","content":"<p>The two red bicycles in <em>Double Phantom/EntroP.R. </em>are fused together so that they share the same rear wheel while facing opposite directions.</p>"},{"id":"df29ff74-acb6-4ecc-aa35-98c9ecbbaaf4","content":"<p><em>Double</em><em> Phantom/EntroP.R.</em> is a sculpture created by multimedia visual artist Miguel Luciano.</p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["C"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["886da572-2843-47c8-a23a-18ff7d0a6fc6"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice C is the best answer. The sentence correctly describes how the bicycles in the sculpture are fused together: they share the same rear wheel while facing opposite directions.</p><p>Choice A is incorrect. The sentence states that the bicycles are fused together but doesn&rsquo;t describe how they are fused. Choice B is incorrect. The sentence states that there are two bicycles in the sculpture without indicating that they are fused together or describing how they are fused. Choice D is incorrect. It identifies the artist who created the sculpture but doesn&rsquo;t describe how the bicycles are fused together.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"00bb356a","external_id":"e0204d9d-b533-4d08-a0f5-d17a2366902b","vaultid":null,"uId":"e8cb2716-aafc-4af7-b69a-51818dac7b3f","program":"SAT","test_type":1,"test_type_desc":"Reading and Writing","primary_cla